[h1]TraderX Experimental[/h1]

This is the test channel of [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3560310973]TraderX[/url]. It gets new builds before the main item, so you can try upcoming changes early.

[b]For live servers, use the main TraderX item.[/b] Run Experimental on a test server.

Requirements: [b]Community Framework (CF)[/b] only. Don't load it together with the main TraderX item.

All features, the changelog and the setup guide are on the main TraderX page.

Found a bug or have feedback? Join the Discord: https://discord.gg/t9YkApe7K9 (please include your TraderXLogs folder).
